<title>UK: IKB sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>IKB sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager WGZ.</p>
<p> BORROWER   IKB DEUTSCHE INDUSTRIEBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.0	MATURITY    29.NOV.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE  L-28.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.45 PCT  REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEAR ONE, 4.50 PCT FOR YEAR TWO, 5.0 PCT FOR</p>
<p>		 YEAR THREE AND 5.50 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	     L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    DDF	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
